[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:69. The Car Race]
[00:00.520]Lesson 69. | 第69课。
[00:02.470]There is a car race near our town every year. | 每年我们镇附近都会举行一次赛车比赛。
[00:06.501]In 1968, there was a very big race. | 1968年，举行了一场盛大的比赛。
[00:12.515]There were hundreds of people there. | 那里有数百人。
[00:15.730]My wife and I were at the race. | 我妻子和我在那里观看了比赛。
[00:19.125]Our friends, Julie and Jack, were there too. | 我们的朋友朱莉和杰克也在那里。
[00:23.580]You can see us in the crowd. | 你可以在人群中看到我们。
[00:26.305]We are standing on the left. | 我们站在左边。
[00:29.650]There were 20 cars in the race. | 比赛中有20辆赛车。
[00:33.455]There were English cars, French cars, | 有英国车、法国车、
[00:36.735]German cars, Italian cars, | 德国车、意大利车、
[00:39.840]American cars, and Japanese cars. | 美国车和日本车。
[00:44.145]It was an exciting finish. | 这是一个激动人心的结局。
[00:47.195]The winner was Billy Stewart. | 冠军是比利·斯图尔特。
[00:49.835]He was in car number 15. | 他驾驶的是15号赛车。
[00:52.835]Five other cars were just behind him. | 另外五辆车紧随其后。
[00:56.975]On the way home, | 在回家的路上，
[00:59.955]my wife said to me, | 我妻子对我说，
[01:02.395]"Don't drive so quickly. | “别开那么快。
[01:05.145]You're not Billy Stewart." | 你又不是比利·斯图尔特。”